From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:38:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/core: remove a core_filter_out() call

This doesn't break test.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/core.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/core.c b/mm/damon/core.c
index 15919bdd6c4d4..e4dccfcb7e801 100644
--- a/mm/damon/core.c
+++ b/mm/damon/core.c
@@ -3810,8 +3810,6 @@ static void damos_adjust_quota(struct damon_ctx *c, struct damos *s)
 		damon_for_each_region(r, t) {
 			if (!__damos_valid_target(r, s, c, t))
 				continue;
-			if (damos_core_filter_out(c, t, r, s))
-				continue;
 			score = c->ops.get_scheme_score(c, r, s);
 			c->regions_score_histogram[score] +=
 				damon_sz_region(r);
-- 
2.47.3

